{
    "chapter_num": 9,
    "verses_count": 27,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Pattern of Self-Denial"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Am I not an apostle? Am I not free? Have I not seen Jesus Christ our Lord? Are you not my work in the Lord? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If I am not an apostle to others, yet doubtless I am to you. For you are the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "certification"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "seal of my apostleship in the Lord."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "My defense to those who examine me is this: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do we have no "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "authority"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "right to eat and drink? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do we have no right to take along "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. a sister, a wife"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "a believing wife, as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "do"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " also the other apostles, the brothers of the Lord, and Cephas? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Or "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " only Barnabas and I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " have no right to refrain from working? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Who ever goes to war at his own expense? Who plants a vineyard and does not eat of its fruit? Or who tends a flock and does not drink of the milk of the flock?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do I say these things as a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "mere"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " man? Or does not the law say the same also? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For it is written in the law of Moses, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“You shall not muzzle an ox while it treads out the grain.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Is it oxen God is concerned about? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Or does He say "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " altogether for our sakes? For our sakes, no doubt, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " is written, that he who plows should plow in hope, and he who threshes in hope should be partaker of his hope. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If we have sown spiritual things for you, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a great thing if we reap your material things? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If others are partakers of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " right over you, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " we not even more?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nevertheless we have not used this right, but endure all things lest we hinder the gospel of Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do you not know that those who minister the holy things eat "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of the things"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the temple, and those who serve at the altar partake of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the offerings of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the altar? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Even so the Lord has commanded that those who preach the gospel should live from the gospel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But I have used none of these things, nor have I written these things that it should be done so to me; for it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "would be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " better for me to die than that anyone should make my boasting void. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if I preach the gospel, I have nothing to boast of, for necessity is laid upon me; yes, woe is me if I do not preach the gospel! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if I do this willingly, I have a reward; but if against my will, I have been entrusted with a stewardship. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "What is my reward then? That when I preach the gospel, I may present the gospel "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits of Christ"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of Christ without charge, that I may not abuse my authority in the gospel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Serving All Men"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For though I am free from all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " I have made myself a servant to all, that I might win the more; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and to the Jews I became as a Jew, that I might win Jews; to those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " under the law, as under the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU adds though not being myself under the law"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "law, that I might win those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " under the law; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " without law, as without law (not being without "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU God’s law"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "law toward God, but under "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Christ’s law"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "law toward Christ), that I might win those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " without law; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to the weak I became "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "as weak, that I might win the weak. I have become all things to all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that I might by all means save some. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now this I do for the gospel’s sake, that I may be partaker of it with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Striving for a Crown"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do you not know that those who run in a race all run, but one receives the prize? Run in such a way that you may "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "win"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "obtain "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And everyone who competes "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "for the prize"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "exercises self-control"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "is temperate in all things. Now they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "do it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to obtain a perishable crown, but we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "for"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " an imperishable "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "crown."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore I run thus: not with uncertainty. Thus I fight: not as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " beats the air. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But I discipline my body and bring "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " into subjection, lest, when I have preached to others, I myself should become disqualified."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}